Cell["\<\
The two methods decide the same candidates; the tower prunes at the cheap \
shallow levels, the annihilator method solves once at the deepest:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->303479067,ExpressionUUID->"9b543dc3-84fd-492c-9963-a6291b05e81e"],

